# Marketplace feed

Products with marketplace: true are syndicated to the marketplace. The marketplace requires every
listed item to ship within 2 business days; listing an item we can't ship gets the seller account
suspended.
=== docs/warehouse-api.md
# Warehouse partner API

We PUT /stock with [{sku, quantity}] every five minutes. quantity must be an integer >= 0. The
partner rejects the whole batch, for every SKU, if any value is negative or not an integer.
